Z||000003||Carrolles||01-01-2000||11:15 PM||||If you can't get your chime unit repaired or replaced you can install an inexpensive ( like around $5.00) buzzer hooked to the fuse block that buzzes when the lights are left on.  I got several at K-mart but you can get the same buzzer at RadioShack for under $3.00.  Make sure it is a 12 volt buzzer.  They are around 1/2" by 1" by 3/4" in size and have two wires attached.<P>If you want to try this I'll detail what hooks where for you.<P>I've used these on several cars, GM and foreign.<P>Good luck.<P>Carroll||||reg||1
